# ============================================================
# Shell — manage and run shell commands (exec).
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### Run shell command
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/shell
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "ls -la",
  "cwd": "/tmp",
  "timeout": 5000
}

### List shell processes
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/shell

### Get shell process
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/shell/{{id}}

### Remove shell process
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/api/shell/{{id}}

### Read shell output
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/shell/{{id}}/output

### Update shell timeout
PATCH {{BASE_URL}}/api/shell/{{id}}/timeout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeout": 10000
}
